<title>UK: Household Bank sets $300 million seven-year FRN.</title>
<headline>Household Bank sets $300 million seven-year FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by lead manager Morgan Stanley.</p>
<p> BORROWER   HOUSEHOLD BANK (NEVADA)</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  HOUSEHOLD FINANCE CORP</p>
<p> AMT    $300 MLN	SPREAD     +18.75 BP MATURITY	.OCT.03</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 BASE	 3M LIBOR  PAY DATE    22.OCT.96</p>
<p> LAST MOODY A2	  ISS PRICE  99.757    FULL FEES   0.25</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   A	   REOFFER    99.757</p>
<p> LISTING    LUX	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 GOV LAW     NEW YORK</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF THE EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
